WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.431
Mandy is an active young woman.

2
00:00:03.432 --> 00:00:06.605
She goes to school like other people her age.

3
00:00:06.606 --> 00:00:10.503
She is studying music.

4
00:00:10.504 --> 00:00:13.449
But Mandy is special in one way.

5
00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:17.995
Everywhere she goes, her best friend Henry leads her.

6
00:00:17.996 --> 00:00:22.198
Mandy is blind and Henry is her guide dog.

7
00:00:22.199 --> 00:00:26.696
Mandy and Henry do everything together.

8
00:00:26.697 --> 00:00:29.930
Not all dogs can become guide dogs.

9
00:00:29.931 --> 00:00:32.495
Guide dogs have to be smart.

10
00:00:32.496 --> 00:00:36.212
They also have to be faithful to their owners.

11
00:00:36.213 --> 00:00:43.326
German shepherds, golden retrievers, and Labradors like Henry make good guide dogs.

12
00:00:43.327 --> 00:00:47.293
Guide dogs start their training at a very young age.

13
00:00:47.294 --> 00:00:53.467
About seven or eight weeks after a puppy is born, it moves in with a family.

14
00:00:53.468 --> 00:00:56.727
These families are called puppy raisers.

15
00:00:56.728 --> 00:01:00.823
They volunteer to raise the puppy for one year.

16
00:01:00.824 --> 00:01:08.024
It is important for guide dogs to feel safe and to have lots of love.

17
00:01:08.025 --> 00:01:11.599
They must learn to get along with other people.

18
00:01:11.600 --> 00:01:15.649
They must learn to get along with other animals.

19
00:01:15.650 --> 00:01:18.959
Henry's first family was the Martins.

20
00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:21.632
The Martins had two little girls.

21
00:01:21.633 --> 00:01:24.528
Their names were Anna and Mimi.

22
00:01:24.529 --> 00:01:28.494
They loved Henry very much.

23
00:01:28.495 --> 00:01:32.285
At night, Henry slept with Anna and Mimi.

24
00:01:32.286 --> 00:01:36.627
It is important for guide dogs to sleep inside the house.

25
00:01:36.628 --> 00:01:43.493
The Martins took care of Henry and loved him as part of their family.

26
00:01:43.494 --> 00:01:48.655
After one year, it was time for Henry to return to the school.

27
00:01:48.656 --> 00:01:51.459
Henry began his special training.

28
00:01:51.460 --> 00:01:55.056
He learned how to obey commands. "Sit!"

29
00:01:55.057 --> 00:02:01.198
"Come here!" He learned to wait for the traffic light to change.

30
00:02:01.199 --> 00:02:04.880
Henry was almost ready to be a guide dog.

31
00:02:04.881 --> 00:02:09.000
First, he and Mandy received training together.

32
00:02:09.001 --> 00:02:13.669
Mandy learned to give Henry orders and how to take care of him.

33
00:02:13.670 --> 00:02:19.013
Henry learned to love and trust his new owner.

34
00:02:19.014 --> 00:02:22.066
Mandy walked with Henry to her school.

35
00:02:22.067 --> 00:02:24.295
Then they walked back home.

36
00:02:24.296 --> 00:02:32.428
Before long, Henry knew how to get to school and back by himself.

37
00:02:32.429 --> 00:02:36.915
Henry makes sure that Mandy is safe wherever she goes.

38
00:02:36.916 --> 00:02:42.789
Henry is happy to take care of Mandy. "Thanks, Henry."

39
00:02:42.790 --> 00:02:47.586
Even at home, Mandy and Henry spend every moment together.

40
00:02:47.587 --> 00:02:50.113
Mandy likes to play the piano.

41
00:02:50.114 --> 00:02:54.159
And Henry likes to sing along!

42
00:02:54.160 --> 00:02:58.594
Mandy does not feel less able because she is blind.

43
00:02:58.595 --> 00:03:02.146
She feels special because she has Henry.

44
00:03:02.147 --> 00:03:10.721
Not only is Henry her guide dog, he is her best friend.

